# Skipped deliberately, because the Enterprise oracle cannot tell them apart: the CPA group's rung
# (enterprise and professional both pass), the two Advanced-tier conjunctions (both false on the
# pair however the `&&` is bent), the load metric's arithmetic (rounds to the same number), and the
# guest-login arm (both ids masked to one). The last two lines are the no-op controls and must SURVIVE.
